WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:16.850
House of the Dragon is an upcoming Game of
Thrones prequel series based on George R.R.

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:21.540
Martin’s Fire &amp; Blood, a history of House
Targaryen set 300 years before the events

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:25.779
in GoT.
The show begins filming in January 2021 and

00:00:25.779 --> 00:00:29.760
will air sometime in 2022, most likely in
April.

00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:34.860
Set 300 years before the events of Game of
Thrones, the series tells the story of a turbulent

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:40.230
period for House Targaryen, one that set sibling
against sibling and dragon against dragon.

00:00:40.230 --> 00:00:43.730
The point of contention: who should rule on
the Iron Throne, of course.

00:00:43.730 --> 00:00:47.620
“If you’d like to know a bit more of what
the show will be about… well, I can’t

00:00:47.620 --> 00:00:51.940
actually spill those beans,” Martin teased
in his blog, “but you might want to pick

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:57.450
up a copy of two anthologies I did with Gardner
Dozois, Dangerous Women, and Rogues and then

00:00:57.450 --> 00:01:00.530
move on to Archmaester Gyldayn’s history,
Fire &amp; Blood.”

00:01:00.530 --> 00:01:05.880
Dangerous Women includes what press materials
describe as a “35,000-word novella” by

00:01:05.880 --> 00:01:09.960
Martin called “The Princess and the Queen,
or, the Blacks and the Greens,” which is

00:01:09.960 --> 00:01:14.600
“about the Dance of the Dragons, the vast
civil war that tore Westeros apart nearly

00:01:14.600 --> 00:01:17.610
two centuries before the events of A Game
of Thrones.”

00:01:17.610 --> 00:01:21.530
The Greens were the faction during the Dance
of the Dragons that supported the claim of

00:01:21.530 --> 00:01:26.860
Aegon ll Targaryen, their rivals being the
Blacks, who supported the claim of Rhaenyra

00:01:26.860 --> 00:01:31.470
Targaryen. Both were named for the color of
their clothes worn during one tourney.

00:01:31.470 --> 00:01:36.020
Rogues, meanwhile, includes Martin’s story
“The Rogue Prince, or, a King’s Brother,”

00:01:36.020 --> 00:01:42.009
which chronicles “the early life, adventures,
misdeeds, and marriages of Prince Daemon Targaryen,”

00:01:42.009 --> 00:01:46.150
considered “one of the biggest rogues in
the entire history of Ice and Fire.”

00:01:46.150 --> 00:01:50.700
Finally, the novel Fire &amp; Blood, released
in November 2018, is the first novel of a

00:01:50.700 --> 00:01:56.100
two-part history of the Targaryens in Westeros.
“Centuries before the events of A Game of

00:01:56.100 --> 00:02:00.440
Thrones, House Targaryen — the only family
of dragonlords to survive the Doom of Valyria

00:02:00.440 --> 00:02:05.240
— took up residence on Dragonstone,” according
to the book’s description on the author’s

00:02:05.240 --> 00:02:10.060
site. “Fire &amp; Blood begins their tale with
the legendary Aegon the Conqueror, creator

00:02:10.060 --> 00:02:14.540
of the Iron Throne, and goes on to recount
the generations of Targaryens who fought to

00:02:14.540 --> 00:02:20.100
hold that iconic seat, all the way up to the
civil war that nearly tore their dynasty apart.”

00:02:20.100 --> 00:02:24.660
In addition to this, few casting calls have
been known, I’m speaking of that of Daemon

00:02:24.660 --> 00:02:28.770
Targaryen, the Rogue Prince, further confirming
that the House of the Dragon will be about

00:02:28.770 --> 00:02:31.670
Dance of the Dragons, the Targaryen civil
war.

00:02:31.670 --> 00:02:37.489
Miguel Sapochnik and Ryan Condal will serve
as showrunners and executive producers. George

00:02:37.489 --> 00:02:40.510
R. R. Martin will also serve as executive
producer.

00:02:40.510 --> 00:02:44.760
This summer, it was reported that HBO has
released a casting call for George RR Martin's

00:02:44.760 --> 00:02:49.990
favorite Targaryen, Daemon Targaryen, key
figure from this time period of the Dance

00:02:49.990 --> 00:02:52.819
of the Dragons.
But who really is this George RR Martin's

00:02:52.819 --> 00:02:58.310
favorite Targaryen and how big his role will
be in the upcoming Game of Thrones prequel.

00:02:58.310 --> 00:03:02.050
Daemon Targaryen also known as Prince of the
City, Lord Flea Bottom and the Rogue Prince

00:03:02.050 --> 00:03:07.400
had many titles throughout his life: Prince,
Ser, Commander of the City Watch, Master of

00:03:07.400 --> 00:03:13.350
Coin, master of laws, King of the stepstones
and the narrow sea, protector of the realm.

00:03:13.350 --> 00:03:18.349
Daemon was the most controversial man of his
lifetime, an audacious rogue prince and adventuer

00:03:18.349 --> 00:03:21.519
who seemed made of good and evil in equal
measure.

00:03:21.519 --> 00:03:26.489
There was never a man so loved and so reviled,
and at the same time, as he was.

00:03:26.489 --> 00:03:31.209
During the Dance of the Dragons, as the husband
of his niece Rhaenyra, he supported his wife's

00:03:31.209 --> 00:03:35.330
claim, and he was considered by many the most
dangerous man in Westeros.

00:03:35.330 --> 00:03:40.580
He was Rhaenyra's second husband, following
Ser Laenor Velaryon and she was his third

00:03:40.580 --> 00:03:43.340
wife.
Prince Daemon was the most experienced warrior

00:03:43.340 --> 00:03:48.549
of his time and wielded the Valyrian steel
blade Dark Sister. A dragon rider whose dragon

00:03:48.549 --> 00:03:53.569
was Caraxes, Daemon declared himself the King
of the Stepstones and the Narrow Sea.

00:03:53.569 --> 00:03:58.489
Daemon was a skilled warrior, described in
the histories as dashing, daring, and dangerous.

00:03:58.489 --> 00:04:03.909
He was also ambitious, impetuous, mercurial,
amoral, reckless, and quick to take offense.

00:04:03.909 --> 00:04:08.250
He is described as being as charming as he
was hot-tempered.

00:04:08.250 --> 00:04:13.069
Starting from the very beginning, Daemon was
born as the second son of Prince Baelon Targaryen

00:04:13.069 --> 00:04:19.750
and his sister-wife, Princess Alyssa Targaryen,
in 81 AC, during the reign of his grandfather,

00:04:19.750 --> 00:04:25.580
King Jaehaerys I Targaryen. He had one older
brother, Viserys, as well as one younger brother,

00:04:25.580 --> 00:04:28.490
Aegon.
Since his youth, Daemon's face was familiar

00:04:28.490 --> 00:04:34.030
to every cut-purse, every lady of the night,
and every gambler in Flea Bottom. He was knighted

00:04:34.030 --> 00:04:39.370
at sixteen, and King Jaehaerys I Targaryen
gave him Dark Sister for his martial skill

00:04:39.370 --> 00:04:43.900
and prowess.
Daemon' first marriage was to Lady Rhea Royce,

00:04:43.900 --> 00:04:49.690
but he disliked both her and the Vale of Arryn.
During the Great Council of 101 AC, Daemon

00:04:49.690 --> 00:04:55.060
supported the claim of Prince Viserys, as
it would make Daemon the heir after his brother.

00:04:55.060 --> 00:05:00.020
Daemon gathered a small army when it was rumored
that Lord Corlys Velaryon was readying a fleet

00:05:00.020 --> 00:05:05.780
to defend the rights of his son, Laenor Velaryon,
who's mother was Rhaenys Targaryen. They would

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:10.580
later become closest allies.
Daemon served briefly as master of coin from

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:18.370
103 AC until 104 AC and master of laws for
six months after that. Governance bored Daemon.

00:05:18.370 --> 00:05:21.730
Daemon was appointed Commander of the City
Watch of King's Landing.

00:05:21.730 --> 00:05:27.169
Daemon inspired loyalty with many of the rank-and-file
men of the City Watch, improving their armaments

00:05:27.169 --> 00:05:32.150
and equipment. He gave every man a golden
cloak, which led to the guards becoming known

00:05:32.150 --> 00:05:36.240
as the gold cloaks.
Daemon developed a dark reputation for the

00:05:36.240 --> 00:05:39.160
harsh punishments.
He became acquainted with a lady of the night

00:05:39.160 --> 00:05:44.640
named Mysaria who would serve as his mistress
of whisperers in the streets of Flea Bottom.

00:05:44.640 --> 00:05:49.440
While Daemon called himself the "Prince of
the City", he became known as "Lord Flea Bottom"

00:05:49.440 --> 00:05:54.509
among the residents of King's Landing.
Daemon considered himself his brother's heir

00:05:54.509 --> 00:06:00.160
as Viserys had no living sons, and he coveted
the title Prince of Dragonstone, which the

00:06:00.160 --> 00:06:04.830
king refused to grant.
Viserys's first wife, Aemma Arryn, died birthing

00:06:04.830 --> 00:06:10.680
Baelon Targaryen, Viserys's second son, the
first having died in the cradle. Baelon died

00:06:10.680 --> 00:06:15.710
a day after his birth, however. Daemon was
observed in the Street of Silk making drunken

00:06:15.710 --> 00:06:21.009
jokes about the "heir for a day". When word
of this reached the grieving Viserys,

00:06:21.009 --> 00:06:25.080
the enraged king had Rhaenyra, his daughter
and Daemon's niece and future wife, declared

00:06:25.080 --> 00:06:31.199
heir in response to his ungrateful brother's
apathy. Daemon left the capital in a fury.

00:06:31.199 --> 00:06:36.450
On Dragonstone, Daemon impregnated his lover,
Mysaria. He wanted to present her with a dragon

00:06:36.450 --> 00:06:41.511
egg. The angry Viserys demanded that Daemon
return the egg and that he return to his wife

00:06:41.511 --> 00:06:47.479
in the Vale. Daemon sent Mysaria to Lys, but
Mysaria's ship sailed through a storm in the

00:06:47.479 --> 00:06:52.350
narrow sea and Mysaria lost the child. This
hardened Daemon against his brother.

00:06:52.350 --> 00:06:58.181
In 106 AC, Daemon led an army to invade the
Stepstones in the southern narrow sea, with

00:06:58.181 --> 00:07:03.630
the support of Lord Corlys Velaryon and his
fleet, and with the use of Daemon's dragon,

00:07:03.630 --> 00:07:07.169
Caraxes.
After conquering all but two of the islands,

00:07:07.169 --> 00:07:12.729
Daemon declared himself King of the Stepstones
and the Narrow Sea in 109 AC, being crowned

00:07:12.729 --> 00:07:17.979
by Corlys the Sea Snake.
Bored with ruling his meager kingdom, Daemon

00:07:17.979 --> 00:07:21.960
returned to the capital of
King's Landing in 111 AC during the tourney

00:07:21.960 --> 00:07:27.490
that gave the greens and the blacks their
names. He reconciled with Viserys I Targaryen

00:07:27.490 --> 00:07:33.320
by offering him his Stepstones crown. Viserys
welcomed his brother's return and Daemon was

00:07:33.320 --> 00:07:37.810
given a seat on the small council.
Neither age or exile had changed Daemon's

00:07:37.810 --> 00:07:42.190
nature, however.
Daemon was cold with Viserys's second wife,

00:07:42.190 --> 00:07:46.949
Queen Alicent Hightower, and her children,
who had pushed him further down in the line

00:07:46.949 --> 00:07:50.860
of succession.
Daemon spent hours in the company of his niece,

00:07:50.860 --> 00:07:55.610
Princess Rhaenyra Targaryen, praising her
beauty, enthralling her with tales of his

00:07:55.610 --> 00:08:01.130
adventures, giving her gifts, and mocking
her stepmother and her greens.

00:08:01.130 --> 00:08:05.700
Six months after his return, it was rumored
that Daemon took Rhaenyra's virginity prior

00:08:05.700 --> 00:08:10.030
to her sixteenth name day and Daemon was exiled
again.

00:08:10.030 --> 00:08:15.630
Daemon returned to Bloodstone in the Stepstones
and resumed his struggle over his barren kingdom.

00:08:15.630 --> 00:08:21.470
Daemon's wife, Rhea Royce, died from falling
from a horse in 115 AC. Daemon departed to

00:08:21.470 --> 00:08:26.680
the Vale of Arryn to claim Runestone, which
had been Rhea's seat, but he was refused by

00:08:26.680 --> 00:08:32.229
House Royce. Not welcome in the Vale, Daemon
turned to Driftmark, where he laid eyes upon

00:08:32.229 --> 00:08:37.690
the enchanting Laena Velaryon, the beautiful
daughter of his friend, Lord Corlys. After

00:08:37.690 --> 00:08:43.419
killing in a duel Laena's betrothed, the son
of the Sealord of Braavos, Daemon asked the

00:08:43.419 --> 00:08:47.470
Sea Snake for his daughter's hand.
Because the marriage had been without consent

00:08:47.470 --> 00:08:53.680
of King Viserys I Targaryen, Daemon and Laena
left Westeros, abandoned the Stepstones, and

00:08:53.680 --> 00:08:58.430
toured the Free Cities. They remained in Pentos
for some time when they learned that Laena

00:08:58.430 --> 00:09:05.019
was pregnant, causing their daughters Baela
and Rhaena to be born there in 116 AC. Daemon

00:09:05.019 --> 00:09:09.820
wrote his brother begging leave to present
his daughters to court to receive a royal

00:09:09.820 --> 00:09:13.350
blessing.
The small council advised the king to refuse,

00:09:13.350 --> 00:09:17.820
but Viserys replied, "Daemon is a father now.
He will have changed."

00:09:17.820 --> 00:09:23.490
After giving his 2 daughters, Daemon's second
wife Laena died in 120 AC, trying to birth

00:09:23.490 --> 00:09:28.640
him a son who died as well.
In 120 AC Daemon married again, this time

00:09:28.640 --> 00:09:33.890
to his niece, Princess Rhaenyra Targaryen.
This marriage was performed suddenly without

00:09:33.890 --> 00:09:39.800
the knowledge of King Viserys I Targaryen,
and was scandalous since neither Laena nor

00:09:39.800 --> 00:09:44.110
Laenor Velaryon, Daemon's previous wife and
Rhaenyra's previous husband, had been dead

00:09:44.110 --> 00:09:49.470
for six months. According to Mushroom, it
was Daemon who arranged the death of Laenor

00:09:49.470 --> 00:09:54.589
by paying Ser Correy to kill him, thus making
Rhaenyra available to marry.

00:09:54.589 --> 00:10:00.880
Daemon and Rhaenyra had two sons together,
Prince Aegon the Younger born in 120 AC and

00:10:00.880 --> 00:10:06.899
Prince Viserys, born in 122 AC.
While Viserys I Targaryen had decreed Rhaenyra

00:10:06.899 --> 00:10:13.700
Targaryen his heir, Ser Criston Cole crowned
Queen Alicent Hightower's son, Aegon II Targaryen,

00:10:13.700 --> 00:10:19.440
after Viserys's death in 129 AC.
The Greens took advantage of being in Kings

00:10:19.440 --> 00:10:24.471
Landing at the time of the death of King Viserys
and took the throne while most of the Blacks

00:10:24.471 --> 00:10:27.980
were at Dragonstone.
At the start of the civil war called the Dance

00:10:27.980 --> 00:10:34.279
of the Dragons, Prince Daemon had more experience
in warfare than all their foes combined. During

00:10:34.279 --> 00:10:38.790
Rhaenyra's rival coronation on Dragonstone,
Daemon placed the crown of King Jaehaerys

00:10:38.790 --> 00:10:44.860
I Targaryen on the head of his wife, proclaiming
her queen and claiming himself Protector of

00:10:44.860 --> 00:10:48.459
the Realm.
Daemon led the assault on Harrenhal, capturing

00:10:48.459 --> 00:10:53.540
the ruined castle from its castellan.
After hearing of the death of his stepson,

00:10:53.540 --> 00:10:58.170
Prince Lucerys Velaryon, at the hands of his
nephew, Prince Aemond Targaryen,

00:10:58.170 --> 00:11:04.089
Daemon, through his spymaster and former mistress
Mysaria, hired Blood and Cheese to murder

00:11:04.089 --> 00:11:09.800
a son of Aegon II. Son for a son.
Daemon abandoned Harrenhal when Aemond and

00:11:09.800 --> 00:11:13.960
Criston began marching on the great castle
with a host of greens

00:11:13.960 --> 00:11:19.630
Instead, Daemon flew Caraxes back to King's
Landing and assisted Rhaenyra with capturing

00:11:19.630 --> 00:11:22.870
the city.
He made his niece and wife, Rhaenyra the Queen

00:11:22.870 --> 00:11:26.880
of the Seven Kingdoms-
While searching for Aemond and Vhagar, who

00:11:26.880 --> 00:11:32.200
were burning the Riverlands, Daemon took dragon
seed Nettles for a bedmate and made their

00:11:32.200 --> 00:11:36.079
base in Maidenpool.
Maester Norren informed Daemon that Queen

00:11:36.079 --> 00:11:41.459
Rhaenyra wanted Nettles dead because some
dragon seeds betrayed her. Daemon thanked

00:11:41.459 --> 00:11:46.279
the maester for the warning and he and Nettles
separated the next morning.

00:11:46.279 --> 00:11:52.120
Daemon challenged Aemond, waiting for thirteen
days at Harrenhal until Aemond stopped burning

00:11:52.120 --> 00:11:56.910
the Riverlands to come face him.
On the 14th day just as Daemon was about to

00:11:56.910 --> 00:12:02.430
slash a 14th mark at the heart tree in the
godswood to mark each passing day, a shadow

00:12:02.430 --> 00:12:06.860
swept over the castle.
Vhagar had come at last and on her back

00:12:06.860 --> 00:12:12.720
rode one-eyed Prince Aemond. He had not come
alone. Pregnant with his child, Alys Rivers

00:12:12.720 --> 00:12:18.019
flew with him. Alys helped Aemond find Daemon
as she saw him in the fire.

00:12:18.019 --> 00:12:22.440
The Prince helped his woman down from Vhagar's
back, then turned to face

00:12:22.440 --> 00:12:27.320
his uncle, calling him a fool for coming to
face him alone because his dragon is the oldest

00:12:27.320 --> 00:12:32.050
and most powerful dragon, on which Daemon
replied ''were I not alone, you would not

00:12:32.050 --> 00:12:35.290
have come''.
Finally, Aemond says to him ''you have lived

00:12:35.290 --> 00:12:40.209
too long'' and Daemon replies ''on that much
we agree'' before climbing their dragons.

00:12:40.209 --> 00:12:45.430
When he climbed upon Caraxes, Daemon did not
fasten his chains that connected him.

00:12:45.430 --> 00:12:50.000
Since Daemon's dragon was a lot younger and
smaller than Aemond's, Daemon was quickly

00:12:50.000 --> 00:12:55.139
hidden in clouds whilst Aemon looked for him.
When Caraxes attacked Vhagar, she ripped upon

00:12:55.139 --> 00:13:00.060
his stomach and tore one of his wings, but
then Caraxes fastened his jaws around her

00:13:00.060 --> 00:13:05.360
throat in death grip.
These injuries forced them both to cease flying

00:13:05.360 --> 00:13:09.980
and as they tumbled to the water below, Daemon
dueled Aemond to the death.

00:13:09.980 --> 00:13:15.339
As he never fastened his saddle, Daemon stood
up on Caraxes and leapt at Aemond,

00:13:15.339 --> 00:13:19.889
whereupon he drove his Dark Sister through
Aemond's eye and through his neck, just a

00:13:19.889 --> 00:13:24.079
second before hitting the water.
The Battle Above the Gods Eye ended in the

00:13:24.079 --> 00:13:30.500
deaths of both riders and both dragons. Daemon
was forty-nine when he died. Unlike Aemond's

00:13:30.500 --> 00:13:35.610
body, however, Daemon's was never found. Singers
say that Daemon lived to spend the rest of

00:13:35.610 --> 00:13:39.890
his days in secret with Nettles, but most
historians disagree.

00:13:39.890 --> 00:13:44.950
I actually believe Daemon didn't die here,
and I have a very good theory about it which

00:13:44.950 --> 00:13:49.079
I will post in the following days.
Daemon never achieved his ambition to sit

00:13:49.079 --> 00:13:55.230
on the Iron Throne, though his sons Aegon
III and Viserys II eventually did.

00:13:55.230 --> 00:13:59.550
In conclusion, House of the Dragon is coming.
Daemon Targaryen will be one of the main characters

00:13:59.550 --> 00:14:03.360
and probably my favorite, just like he is
George RR Martin's favorite.

00:14:03.360 --> 00:14:08.941
''Over the centuries, House Targaryen has
produced both great men and monsters. Prince

00:14:08.941 --> 00:14:14.810
Daemon was both. In his day there was not
a man so admired, so beloved, and so reviled

00:14:14.810 --> 00:14:20.339
in all Westeros. He was made of light and
darkness in equal parts. To some, he was a

00:14:20.339 --> 00:14:23.152
hero, to others the blackest of villains.''
- writings of Gyldayn

00:14:23.152 --> 00:14:26.970
This is a good description of Daemon.
The best description comes from George RR

00:14:26.970 --> 00:15:08.209
Martin 

00:15:08.209 --> 00:15:25.860
of course:
I honestly cannot wait for House of the Dragon.

00:15:25.860 --> 00:15:29.930
Let me know which side you're on, are you
supporting the Greens or the Blacks in the

00:15:29.930 --> 00:15:33.699
Targaryen civil war.
Thank you so much for watching, hope you liked

00:15:33.699 --> 00:15:42.800
this video and if you did please give it a
big thumbs up and until the next one! Peace!

